xpanding and doing  more stuff like that it's exciting and I  also had to ask too I mean gotta bring  up the amazing performance you did as  Elton and was winning the Golden Globe  so far the highlight of your crew would  you say and are you praying to that  thing every morning you got that like in  the shrine uh I I couldn't my apartment  um uh no Shrine um  uh like uh yes it you know it was it the  Highlight I don't know if it was it was  a great moment and you know I think  it felt like a really  um  it felt like quite a nice moment to kind  of end what had been a really long  journey with rocket man because more  than anything else I'd done I I it was  two years of my life because of all the  music and then the promoting of it was a  kind of extended process as well  um but you know the you know the best  moment of my career I don't know really  you know the best moment of my career  was probably when we screened it at can  and that was that when it went and and  we had a sense that people were really  loved it that that was that was that was  up there that probably more that than  the Globes although man the gloves was a  great night yeah yeah and that's  exciting I think what's going to excite  people is just gonna be another project  they're gonna see Blackbird where  they'll be clapping in their home at  least it might not be a Cairns but  they'll be here and watching loving it  so just know that yeah so Taryn thank  you for joining me today I really  appreciate it and uh watch him kill it  in Blackboard this Friday on Apple TV  plus the first few episodes come out now  and then it'll be week to week have a  great one Taryn thanks so much this was  a really nice chat thank you

